# Production handoff

- Before changing or deploying Weekly, training-similarity, retrospective, or
  lifecycle code, read `docs/production-handoff-2026-08-28.md`.
- Treat its Production state and Shipped contract as the last verified
  baseline; verify live state before assuming it is still current.
- Treat every item under Remaining work as unshipped until Git and deployment
  evidence proves otherwise.
- Update or supersede the handoff after each production deployment or major
  operational milestone. Never record credentials or private runtime values.
